SY_TALK("BKExtYE_-Mk",[[317,["Oh, I would suggest that first let them ask questions today."]],[321,["So I keep myself there…"]],[325,["If you have any questions,"]],[327,["it's better to ask me first."]],[329,["So that your mind is at rest."]],[338,["I'm glad to stand.…better to see people better."]],[352,["Am I better here or on the ground?"]],[360,["Now, first of all it’s better to ask the questions"]],[363,["because yesterday when we started this question session"]],[369,["people got little deviated."]],[371,["It’s better to ask questions now, what you have,"]],[373,["because you are all seekers."]],[375,["You are all seekers and you have been seeking"]],[379,["so is best is to ask questions now, so I’ll be able"]],[382,["to put the answer in between My lecture."]],[432,["No questions?"]],[441,["That means Sahaja Yogis have become quite capable"]],[444,["of explaining Sahaja Yoga and I’m very proud of them."]],[450,["When I went to Australia the newspaper people"]],[453,["asked Me, “Mother, are all Your disciples scholars?”"]],[458,["I said, “No, they are very common people."]],[460,["They have to be very common and normal people.”"]],[463,["But they said, “The way they know things,"]],[465,["surprisingly we feel they are all scholars.”"]],[468,["I said, “All scholarship is within yourself.”"]],[471,["All the knowledge is within yourself."]],[474,["If you only can get light there, you can see"]],[478,["all that knowledge is within you."]],[480,["You don’t have to go anywhere for your knowledge."]],[483,["It’s all inside, everything is built in."]],[488,["You are built in so beautifully to become your Spirit"]],[495,["that I don’t have to do much about it. It just works out."]],[499,["Only thing is that one has to know what"]],[502,["we should expect; to be the Spirit,"]],[505,["what should be our expectation."]],[508,["And that also logically you must understand."]],[511,["It should be a logical conclusion."]],[514,["Not just because I say something,"]],[517,["because you have become a member of some group,"]],[519,["because you have paid money somewhere."]],[521,["It’s not that way. Reality is what it is."]],[525,["And logically it has to be reality."]],[530,["The other day I told you about the left side, about the past,"]],[538,["about the subconscious, about the collective subconscious"]],[540,["and the problems of the subconscious and the conditionings"]],[545,["we get from material things, from matter."]],[549,["Matter is always trying to overpower the Spirit."]],[555,["And this matter is overpowering us because"]],[560,["we come from matter to begin with."]],[564,["But how does the Spirit come out of it?"]],[568,["What happens that we become the Spirit?"]],[576,["People have talked about Self Realization."]],[578,["So many people have talked about second birth."]],[583,["Everyone has said that you are to be born again."]],[586,["There are many people who go about saying,"]],[588,["“I’m twice born,” self certified."]],[591,["You can find all kinds of people in this world,"]],[594,["who are knowing that something has to happen,"]],[601,["some breakthrough has to take place,"]],[604,["something we have to seek."]],[606,["Imagine at the time of Christ there were not"]],[609,["so many people who were seeking,"]],[611,["nobody could talk to the disciples also much."]],[614,["They were just ordinary fishermen, very simple people."]],[618,["But today is the time when you find so many"]],[621,["of seekers all over the world. Seeking what?"]],[626,["What are you seeking? The seeking is of your Spirit."]],[634,["Now this is also a very vague term to say"]],[636,["you are seeking your Spirit."]],[637,["Now what is this Spirit supposed to be?"]],[640,["And why should we seek this Spirit?"]],[644,["In our evolution we are human beings,"]],[649,["our awareness is that of human beings and this awareness"]],[654,["of human beings is not the ultimate."]],[660,["If it was we would not have been seeking."]],[667,["It’s not the end of it."]],[669,["We have to reach at a point where"]],[672,["something more has to happen."]],[676,["Now how do we approach the subject logically?"]],[680,["In our evolution, what has happened to us?"]],[685,["We were animals, from there we became human beings."]],[690,["What is so special about human beings compared to animals?"]],[697,["In the awareness of man there’s a new dimension."]],[701,["For example you can take a horse through a dirty lane,"]],[704,["he doesn’t feel anything, the dirt or filth,"]],[706,["or beauty, colors, nothing. Makes no difference."]],[710,["But if you take a human being through a dirty lane or a"]],[714,["dirty house, immediately he understands, he doesn’t like it."]],[721,["So what has come into us is nothing but in our awareness"]],[726,["a new dimension compared to animals,"]],[731,["or we can say in very scientific way is that in our central"]],[739,["nervous system we have developed a new awareness."]],[747,["Whatever is in our central nervous system,"]],[749,["we are master of that. Supposing I feel this is hot,"]],[754,["everybody will feel this is hot."]],[757,["If I say this is the color of this particular bird,"]],[764,["everybody will say the same thing."]],[768,["So whatever is the awareness of one human being,"]],[770,["awareness I am saying, not the myth, not the hallucination,"]],[773,["but the reality as far as his organs are concerned,"]],[782,["sensory organs are concerned is just the same."]],[786,["A person who feels hot does not say that he feels cold,"]],[791,["nor the other one will come and say it is cold,"]],[794,["they all will say it is hot. So one thing is there,"]],[800,["the truth is one, it cannot be two,"]],[805,["and that whatever has to happen now in our"]],[807,["evolution has to be in our awareness."]],[812,["Like a fish became a turtle."]],[814,["If a fish became a turtle, what happened to her?"]],[818,["It is in the awareness of the turtle,"]],[826,["it started feeling the Mother Earth. It lost something"]],[830,["that fish had and it started feeling something new."]],[834,["In the same way, in our evolution if something"]],[837,["has to happen, we have to be something more"]],[842,["in awareness, more dynamic. For this we can take"]],[848,["help from the writings of so many people."]],[854,["For example we can consider Jung"]],[857,["as one of them who has talked about it."]],[860,["Jung has said that when the breakthrough will take place,"]],[872,["the human beings will become,"]],[874,["will become collectively conscious, will become."]],[879,["He didn’t say that you’ll all start doing the same thing"]],[884,["or you will start behaving in the same manner."]],[887,["No, he said you will become, you will be aware of it,"]],[891,["not unawares. So when you are seeking the Spirit,"]],[895,["if the Spirit has to enlighten you, in your awareness you are"]],[901,["going to know something more than you have known so far."]],[908,["For example, you might feel it hot and cold today"]],[912,["but maybe with that awareness you might"]],[914,["feel something different about it."]],[919,["He has said it very clearly that you have"]],[921,["to become collectively conscious."]],[924,["So the becoming is the point in our evolution,"]],[927,["nothing else, we become something else."]],[931,["In Sanskrit language for example they say, for a realized"]],[935,["Soul, for Indians it’s very common knowledge,"]],[939,["it’s nothing so much difficult to understand,"]],[943,["he’s called as a dwijaha, the one who is born again."]],[949,["And also a bird is called as a dwijaha,"]],[952,["because a bird is born first as an egg and then it grows,"]],[957,["matures and then suddenly it becomes a bird."]],[961,["And that is the parallel of Realization."]],[965,["You also know that on the Easter Day we give eggs."]],[969,["It has the same symbol, that we are eggs and"]],[972,["we have to become the birds."]],[975,["So just now, at this stage when we are human beings"]],[978,["we are just limited like an egg to grow up to a point"]],[986,["where you can become the bird."]],[989,["All other sort of things people talk of is not the Realization."]],[995,["Like I may say that “All right, if I mesmerize you very well,"]],[1000,["I can give you bottles and you might start"]],[1002,["sucking the bottles just like children.”"]],[1006,["Even knowing that you are doing something funny,"]],[1008,["you are doing it."]],[1011,["You’ll be compelled to do it because you are mesmerized."]],[1014,["Any such activity that you fall into is not Realization"]],[1020,["because whatever has happened to you as human beings"]],[1024,["that you are, you have done no activity whatsoever."]],[1029,["We didn’t cut our tails as monkeys to"]],[1031,["become human beings. It has happened spontaneously"]],[1035,["like a flower becoming a fruit. It’s a living process."]],[1040,["One does not realize that whatever has to happen"]],[1043,["to you is a living process, is not a dead process."]],[1047,["What we can do is all dead."]],[1049,["For example we can stand on our heads, we can jump,"]],[1052,["we can run, we can do all kinds of things but"]],[1055,["that is not the living process."]],[1058,["The living process is when you become something,"]],[1062,["and that becoming must be asked by all honest seekers."]],[1066,["If you are not honest, then it’s difficult,"]],[1069,["or even if you are honest and you are misidentified"]],[1072,["with certain ideas you have read because you have paid"]],[1075,["for the book or you have paid for an organization"]],[1076,["or paid for someone, that’s not going to help you."]],[1080,["What we have to see what we become,"]],[1083,["and that’s what yesterday I told that you become the master."]],[1088,["You become the prophet as Blake has said that,"]],[1091,["“God of men [Shri Mataji may mean “Men of God”]"]],[1092,["will become prophets and they will have"]],[1095,["powers to make others prophets.”"]],[1097,["So to be very honest with yourself you should say,"]],[1100,["“Have I become a prophet and can I make others prophets?”"]],[1106,["This is a very simple way of looking at our Realization"]],[1110,["and this what you are capable of,"]],[1113,["that you become the prophet, because everything is within you,"]],[1117,["the whole machinery is within you, you are like a computer,"]],[1119,["you are just to be put to the mains, it will start working."]],[1122,["You have to just become that."]],[1126,["And if you do not become that, then all other things,"]],[1130,["forming an organization and any such thing, is of no use,"]],[1135,["is of no value, is all, I can say, misguidance."]],[1145,["What have you got yourself?"]],[1146,["Supposing, I mean, if Ray has to say something:"]],[1149,["“Oh, Mother saw a light, and this happened and that happened;"]],[1152,["She has these powers, and those powers,” it’s all useless."]],[1156,["What is it to you?"]],[1158,["I may be the king of anything, so what does it matter to you?"]],[1161,["What has become of you is the important thing and for that"]],[1165,["becoming if I say there is everything placed within you"]],[1168,["I have to prove it that’s all."]],[1173,["This knowledge is not unknown to us, actually."]],[1178,["Is all been described from the time of Moses."]],[1181,["Like He says,"]],[1183,["“The tree of fire.” Now what is the tree of fire?"]],[1186,["Nobody knows, they just say there was tree of fire."]],[1190,["But if you see the Kundalini completely enlightened,"]],[1192,["if you can see it really looks like a tree of fire."]],[1198,["And then it is said also in the Bible that,"]],[1201,["“I will appear before you like tongues of flames.”"]],[1204,["Now what is that? No one explains, nobody knows,"]],[1208,["these tongues of flames are nothing but these centers when"]],[1211,["they are enlightened, you see them just like tongues of flames."]],[1216,["But you need not see them because when you are outside"]],[1220,["the pavilion you can see the pavilion; when you are inside"]],[1223,["you don’t see, you just see the hall."]],[1227,["And that is why one should understand that it is not what"]],[1234,["we think should happen, but it is what will"]],[1240,["happen actually we should accept."]],[1243,["So first we should get rid of all misidentifications"]],[1246,["with our ideas that this will happen, that will happen,"]],[1249,["and this should happen, I should see a light,"]],[1252,["I should fly in the air."]],[1255,["There are many people who are paying"]],[1256,["money to fly in the air. I mean it’s absurd."]],[1260,["Why do you want to fly in the air? I don’t understand."]],[1262,["Paying much more money for that than they would"]],[1265,["have to pay to go round the whole world."]],[1268,["I really tell you by plane if you have to travel"]],[1270,["it won’t so expensive as you are paying"]],[1271,["for this flying business, this Flying Squad business."]],[1274,["And what is that, we have to understand, what is that?"]],[1277,["When we go for this flying what are we getting into?"]],[1281,["And this method of mesmerism is so subtle"]],[1285,["that you cannot understand.  You just go on it."]],[1289,["Like the same Flying Squad business, we had a gentleman"]],[1295,["who was the director of the academy,"]],[1299,["down with epilepsy, his wife down with epilepsy,"]],[1302,["the child down with epilepsy; and they all came down to Me,"]],[1306,["they lost their houses, they lost everything, penniless."]],[1311,["This is what has happened to the flying of the whole joke."]],[1315,["Now, one must realize that you cannot pay"]],[1321,["for your evolution, you cannot pay."]],[1324,["It’s very simple to understand."]],[1325,["As I told yesterday that if you pay to this"]],[1327,["flower will it become a fruit?"]],[1330,["It’s a living process for which we cannot pay,"]],[1334,["it doesn’t understand money."]],[1335,["Living processes do not understand money."]],[1337,["I’ve not known any human being,"]],[1339,["supposing he’s suffering from indigestion,"]],[1341,["he’ll put some money there saying that “Now I pay you,"]],[1343,["my stomach, now will you digest my food?”"]],[1346,["Do we do like that?"]],[1347,["In the same way it is the highest of highest living processes"]],[1352,["for which you cannot pay."]],[1356,["It’s a very subtle thing to understand for human beings"]],[1359,["because they believe that for everything one has to pay,"]],[1363,["otherwise it doesn’t work out."]],[1365,["You see you go to a machine, you want to have a good,"]],[1368,["say, machine, you must pay."]],[1371,["Which works, you see. If doesn’t work, you can have free."]],[1374,["But the one that works we have to pay."]],[1376,["Any motorcar, it’s free, means it’s all a junk, you can’t have it."]],[1380,["We have to pay to take it to the junk shop, so it is"]],[1383,["always in the minds of human beings that one has to pay."]],[1389,["And this is very wrong, that you cannot pay."]],[1392,["I’m talking of the processes, which are beyond human,"]],[1398,["the human beings are not doing it."]],[1400,["For example we cannot transform a flower into fruit,"]],[1403,["the living process itself is beyond human reach."]],[1407,["But when you become, when you become"]],[1411,["a superhuman you can handle them."]],[1415,["And this should happen to you."]],[1416,["If it has does not happen to you all the rest"]],[1419,["of the things are wrong."]],[1421,["I’m telling you with great concern because the people who"]],[1425,["are in the market, who are selling goods,"]],[1429,["are doing it very well."]],[1431,["They know how to entice you, they know how to put"]],[1435,["ideas through you, how to give you misidentifications, and you"]],[1439,["just get identified with them till they completely drop out."]],[1446,["And then you are left high and dry."]],[1448,["You say, “Oh, God, what has happened?”"]],[1452,["One thing is there, that your Spirit is not lost."]],[1457,["It is there. Despite whatever the mistakes,"]],[1460,["whatever may be the seeking, but the Spirit resides within"]],[1465,["you despite everything, till you live."]],[1470,["And this Spirit is to be brought into your conscious mind,"]],[1473,["means into your central nervous system,"]],[1477,["you should feel the powers of the Spirit in your being."]],[1481,["This is what is Sahaja Yoga is. Sahaja,"]],[1484,["as he must have told you, means born with you."]],[1487,["Now, yesterday I told you about the left side,"]],[1490,["which is the power of desire, and through this power"]],[1493,["we have our all conditionings and all the reception"]],[1498,["from the matter, materialistic things and also what you can"]],[1502,["say we collect all our past, the past then  extend up"]],[1507,["through the collective subconscious."]],[1509,["I also told you yesterday that cancer is a disease caused"]],[1512,["by the left side extreme behavior of people."]],[1516,["Those who go into the extreme behavior on the left side"]],[1518,["get the disease called cancer and it can be cured if you can"]],[1523,["bring such an extreme case in the center,"]],[1526,["it can be cured, no doubt about it."]],[1529,["Now, the second part is the right side which today I have"]],[1534,["told that I will tell you about."]],[1536,["The gentleman is not here who asked"]],[1538,["so many questions, is he here?"]],[1542,["He was just busy asking questions, that’s all, yesterday."]],[1544,["He’s not interested in seeking, I think."]],[1547,["All right, now the second side on the right hand side,"]],[1549,["is the power by which we act."]],[1553,["First we desire and then we act."]],[1555,["Now this power, right side power, is expressed within"]],[1558,["us as right sympathetic nervous system."]],[1562,["Science has come from the same, science is in the gross,"]],[1565,["these are all subtle things that are within us."]],[1567,["Now this right side power which exists within us,"]],[1570,["gives us the power for our mental and physical capacity to act."]],[1576,["Now this action takes place when we desire something,"]],[1579,["we want to implement that desire then we go into action."]],[1584,["One has to understand what sort of a power is this."]],[1587,["This power is called as prana shakti in Sanskrit."]],[1591,["Prana, and the another one, the left one as mana shakti"]],[1595,["is the power of the emotions or can say of the mind,"]],[1599,["but you see English language is not so clear-cut about it."]],[1603,["So I would say mana shakti and the prana shakti,"]],[1606,["these are the two powers that exist within us and we start"]],[1609,["using them as left and right, we can say like a brake and an"]],[1614,["accelerator and then we become the master of driving."]],[1618,["But while becoming that we make mistakes."]],[1621,["The human mind has a speciality to go to extremes."]],[1625,["Supposing I tell somebody, “Now, you have to meditate.”"]],[1628,["They’ll meditate for five hours."]],[1630,["There is no need to meditate for five hours or anything."]],[1632,["But if you tell them that you have to stand on your head,"]],[1635,["they’ll do it for ten hours."]],[1637,["So there is no need to go to extremes,"]],[1638,["we have to be just in the center, be kind to our body,"]],[1642,["be kind to ourselves."]],[1643,["There’s nothing to be frantic about; there’s nothing to be"]],[1646,["so much exasperated about it."]],[1650,["It’s just very simple thing that has to happen to you."]],[1654,["For example, think of a seed which is sown in a very"]],[1658,["loud music or, say, a place where everybody is rushing,"]],[1662,["shouting, screaming, what will happen to that seed,"]],[1665,["will never sprout."]],[1667,["If it is in a peaceful place, is a properly placed one,"]],[1670,["or not in a tilted pot, then it will definitely develop into"]],[1676,["a beautiful tree or a beautiful shrub,"]],[1681,["whatever it has to develop into."]],[1683,["In the same way if we are too much on the extremes,"]],[1686,["we go to the left and to the right."]],[1688,["Now going to the left, I told you yesterday what happens"]],[1691,["that all these things like hypnosis, and ESP’s and most"]],[1696,["of these gurus try these tricks, you see,"]],[1698,["like they just make you hypnotized and people become"]],[1704,["absolutely mad towards the guru, “He’s our guru,” and"]],[1708,["they behave just like absolutely people without any brains."]],[1712,["“Oh, I feel nice with that guru.” The reason is that"]],[1715,["you feel there’s a sort of a sense of security built-in in"]],[1719,["this gentleman and, “if I’m following him, you see,"]],[1724,["he is going to Heaven and I’m going with him to Heaven.”"]],[1726,["It doesn’t happen like that."]],[1728,["You have to individually go into Heaven yourself and you"]],[1731,["have to become your own guru and you have"]],[1733,["to know everything about it."]],[1734,["It’s not that anybody can put a trailer behind and put some"]],[1740,["people into it and say,"]],[1741,["“Now come along, I’m going to Heaven.”"]],[1743,["Most of these are people are really going to Hell and you"]],[1746,["will follow them very fast."]],[1749,["So it is never so, believe Me, that anybody who says that"]],[1753,["following a certain guru you’ll go to"]],[1755,["Heaven is absolutely wrong."]],[1757,["You must follow in the Principle and every guru who"]],[1760,["is a real guru will always tell you,"]],[1763,["will always tell you that you have to become something."]],[1766,["He’ll never just say, “All right, you’ve given me the money,"]],[1769,["all right, you are the member, now you are my child,"]],[1772,["now you are my disciple and I give you my love."]],[1775,["Let’s have love.” Where is the love? “"]],[1779,["And give more money, give me Rolls Royces,"]],[1781,["give me this, give me that.”"]],[1783,["And like mad we are doing it thinking that"]],[1786,["we can exchange these things."]],[1790,["Now, as we are seekers we have every right to find"]],[1793,["our Spirits and we are not to be deluded by any such"]],[1796,["tricks and pranks of these people or I would say very"]],[1800,["sinister methods that they are employing."]],[1802,["Not only to initiate you for money, I don’t mind"]],[1805,["they are smugglers, let them have money,"]],[1806,["what they want to have; but they spoil your chances"]],[1808,["of Realization which you do not realize."]],[1811,["And once they are spoilt, it’s very difficult to give"]],[1814,["you Realization, and if you do not really,"]],[1816,["positively work it out it’s going to be impossible situation."]],[1822,["I’ve seen people who have suffered on account of this."]],[1826,["Now this action within us acts for our mental and physical"]],[1830,["capacities on the right hand side."]],[1833,["Like we think of the future, now the planning will start,"]],[1836,["this planning, “Now we must do this tomorrow, or day after"]],[1838,["tomorrow we have to do it.” and we start sitting,"]],[1840,["“Now, I’ll go there and I’ll find this and then I’ll take"]],[1843,["a ticket and then I’ll go there.”"]],[1846,["I mean, our mind is working for the future."]],[1848,["So much so, we, we become absolutely futuristic,"]],[1852,["to such an extent sometimes I’ve met people who are futuristic,"]],[1855,["they even forget their own names. Can you believe it?"]],[1858,["I mean they don’t even remember their father’s name."]],[1860,["That’s all right, but even their own names they forget."]],[1862,["I mean they are like mad people because they don’t remember"]],[1866,["their own names and they don’t know"]],[1867,["where are they, what are they doing."]],[1870,["I have met people of that kind who are really sick people"]],[1874,["because they have become so futuristic now that they"]],[1877,["do not know anything about their past."]],[1880,["Now this futuristic behavior starts in a society where"]],[1885,["people always think of the future."]],[1887,["“What will I do, what am I to do tomorrow,"]],[1890,["what am I to achieve tomorrow?”"]],[1892,["And all these things, when they start doing"]],[1895,["their attention goes to the right extreme."]],[1898,["Now, in this place we are very dangerously placed,"]],[1902,["very dangerously placed, when we start looking for the"]],[1905,["future and the future seeing is a imaginary stuff,"]],[1914,["is absolutely imaginary, because what you think"]],[1918,["of the future doesn’t exist. What exists is the present,"]],[1923,["you have to be in the present not in the future."]],[1926,["But people will say you have to be in the present, but how?"]],[1931,["We cannot. Either we are in the past or in the future."]],[1934,["Because when the thought wave rises, it comes up and goes down."]],[1938,["Another thought wave rises, goes up and comes down."]],[1942,["Now, this thought wave which comes up,"]],[1945,["we go with it but we don’t see it’s going down."]],[1948,["Another thought wave that rises, we see that but"]],[1951,["don’t see where it goes out."]],[1953,["And so we are jumping on the cusp of these thoughts"]],[1955,["and we do not know, perhaps we are with the past"]],[1959,["or perhaps with the future. But in the center of these two"]],[1962,["thoughts there is the present and we don’t know"]],[1965,["how to take our attention there, which is a very difficult thing"]],[1968,["and just to say that you should be in the center is not possible."]],[1973,["All these things, “You should do this, you should do that,”"]],[1975,["is not going to work out unless and until there is light."]],[1978,["For example, there is no light in this room and you say,"]],[1981,["“Walk straight,” you cannot walk because you can’t see"]],[1984,["where is the passage, how to walk."]],[1986,["Even if you order, do whatever you please,"]],[1988,["you cannot just walk straight without touching any of these"]],[1991,["chairs because there is no light, you can’t see."]],[1994,["So one has to understand that in the"]],[1997,["futuristic life when we live and we plan too"]],[2000,["much for the future, actually what we are doing,"]],[2003,["we are living in an imaginary world."]],[2006,["We have many stories of people who lived in imaginary"]],[2008,["worlds and how they found that everything was destroyed."]],[2013,["And there are people who work it out through their"]],[2018,["physical efforts, and when they go into their physical"]],[2020,["efforts they create another problem for them because"]],[2024,["they just become physically oriented people."]],[2028,["And if you are just physically oriented,"]],[2031,["the Spirit gets angry with you."]],[2033,["So the right side movement is for the people who"]],[2036,["are very meticulous, you see, which you can call the people"]],[2039,["who are very particular about the time and who are very"]],[2042,["firm about things, who are very dry people and who are very"]],[2047,["straight and they won’t tolerate any nonsense."]],[2050,["One sort of people, you see, that you find normally and"]],[2053,["that sort of people become a headache and"]],[2057,["they are very boring, you see."]],[2060,["You can’t just bear their company,"]],[2061,["they can be very boring people."]],[2063,["And they give you big lectures about how to be"]],[2066,["straightforward and how to walk straight absolutely."]],[2069,["In the nature nothing is straight, it all moves so"]],[2073,["beautifully because the nature is created out of varieties,"]],[2077,["and variety brings the beauty."]],[2079,["They don’t think of beauty, they don’t think of love,"]],[2081,["of compassion, nothing. For them it is a very meticulous"]],[2084,["world and that’s how they live."]],[2087,["Such people are developing a big ego within themselves,"]],[2091,["as you see there, is a yellow stuff in the head called as ego."]],[2097,["By the action of the left side, emotional side,"]],[2103,["we develop a superego, but by the action of the right side"]],[2106,["we develop a ego. Now this ego is not easy to be seen."]],[2111,["Because if you have a superego you have pains"]],[2114,["in the body, you are a miserable person, you have wrinkles"]],[2118,["on the face and you look absolutely worn out."]],[2122,["But if you have ego then you look so dynamic."]],[2125,["We can say that Hitler was the extreme of this ego business."]],[2129,["And he got into his head that he is some sort of a god"]],[2134,["incarnation and that he has to save the people,"]],[2137,["and he was the one who knows about races and everything"]],[2141,["and he is supposed to save some race."]],[2145,["This kind of idea comes from these people who"]],[2148,["are right sided, they are very aggressive, they may be very"]],[2153,["good to talk to, they may be very humble to look at,"]],[2157,["could be very good business men, could be anything,"]],[2160,["but they do not know that they have this Mister Ego"]],[2163,["coming up on their heads just like a big balloon"]],[2166,["and they are floating in the air. The end of ego is stupidity."]],[2170,["You’ll be surprised, the end of ego is stupidity."]],[2172,["Such people indulge into all kinds of stupid things,"]],[2176,["and they say, “What’s wrong?”"]],[2178,["For example I’ve known old people behaving in so"]],[2182,["stupid ways, and they say, “What’s wrong?”"]],[2184,["You know, an old man, say of ninety years,"]],[2187,["Who can’t even walk without a stick, takes to these dances you"]],[2191,["do and then he falls down, you see, and"]],[2194,["he thinks, “what’s wrong?” Like a lady I knew, she was"]],[2197,["about eighty-five, she died from a horse falling down."]],[2201,["Naturally I mean what else you expect at eighty-five,"]],[2204,["that’s what is evident, for a lady of eighty-five she should"]],[2207,["settle down at home, look after her grandchildren,"]],[2209,["maybe she might have great grandchildren, you see."]],[2212,["Instead of that why does she want to be twenty-five-year-old"]],[2214,["lady to climb on a horse?"]],[2217,["So all such stupid things they do and then they will say,"]],[2221,["“What’s wrong?” Is nothing wrong in stupidity, what’s wrong?"]],[2224,["But such people are a nuisance to the society, to others."]],[2230,["The people who are superego are troublesome to themselves,"]],[2234,["but those are egoistical are troublesome to others."]],[2238,["They are all the time correcting others, torturing others,"]],[2241,["putting their ideas on to other people, and such people"]],[2245,["can be very, very successful because nothing"]],[2249,["succeeds like success."]],[2250,["They go on hammering things into the heads of people,"]],[2254,["saying, “Now this is true, this is true,”"]],[2256,["and when you go on saying it, this you suddenly believe,"]],[2259,["“Yes, must be so.” And such people are much more dangerous"]],[2262,["I would say from the superego type."]],[2264,["But for people who do not know the tricks of the"]],[2268,["superego they can be very, very, very dangerous because"]],[2276,["they are very subtle, you cannot see them, they mesmerize,"]],[2280,["and they can possess you and they can be very sly, and they can"]],[2286,["work out all sorts of methods which you are not aware."]],[2290,["So it is not easy to choose which is better, which is not better."]],[2294,["Both things are wrong to go to extremes,"]],[2297,["on the right or to the left."]],[2300,["Now let’s see what happens physically."]],[2302,["As I told about the cancer on the left hand side that we do,"]],[2306,["physically what happens to people who are futuristic?"]],[2309,["We have a center specially for futuristic behavior"]],[2312,["called as Swadhisthana Chakra which is in the gross"]],[2316,["manifesting the plexus called the aortic plexus within us."]],[2321,["Now this Swadhisthana Chakra is very important for human"]],[2324,["beings, specially for people who are developed people."]],[2328,["With this chakra actually we convert the fat of the stomach"]],[2333,["for the use of the brain."]],[2335,["Now this is the center of the Surya, of the sun."]],[2340,["Now when we start thinking, these cells are converted"]],[2344,["in such a way that they become useful to the brain."]],[2349,["Now, if you are thinking all the time, all the time"]],[2352,["you are thinking, then what will happen?"]],[2354,["I mean the horns are not going to grow out of that."]],[2357,["You are consuming all that, and then you are consuming"]],[2361,["all those cells, you have to have replacement,"]],[2364,["and for that replacement this Swadhisthana Chakra has to work"]],[2368,["very hard to convert the cells for the use of your brain."]],[2373,["Now, when it is doing that there are other things which this"]],[2378,["Swadhisthana Chakra has to look after; for example your liver,"]],[2382,["your pancreas, your spleen, your kidneys, all are to be looked"]],[2388,["after by this center, and also uterus for the ladies."]],[2393,["Now, when there’s only one work is given to this"]],[2396,["Swadhisthan Chakra and it cannot do any other work,"]],[2400,["then other things are neglected, so you develop a"]],[2403,["terrible disease called liver trouble."]],[2407,["Now liver trouble is another thing that you do not feel yourself."]],[2410,["Others know that you are liverish the way you are"]],[2412,["hot tempered, the way you are fussy, the way you always"]],[2418,["snarl at people and the way you are never satisfied"]],[2425,["with anything, the way you criticize others;"]],[2428,["all this is liverish and such liverish people are never happy"]],[2433,["with themselves because liver looks after your attention."]],[2436,["And those who have liver problems, their attention is horrid,"]],[2439,["that goes like this, you see, you cannot keep"]],[2441,["your attention straight. On the street you’ll walk straight"]],[2444,["into a car because you are looking at something which"]],[2446,["you are not supposed to look."]],[2448,["But all the time you are looking at like this,"]],[2450,["you cannot walk, I mean you won’t find any animal like"]],[2452,["that who walks like this, but only human beings do it."]],[2455,["If you see them on the street you’ll be amazed."]],[2457,["Where are they walking? They don’t walk straight,"]],[2459,["they don’t look straight, but their eyes are going this way,"]],[2461,["that way, because the attention is wobbly,"]],[2463,["the attention is wobbly because of a bad liver."]],[2466,["So this liver is a very, very important thing."]],[2470,["Now, this liver has a special capacity to extract all the poisons"]],[2475,["from the body as heat, and the heat in the body is to be"]],[2480,["transformed or should be conveyed to the blood,"]],[2485,["or the water in the blood, and that has to be taken out"]],[2489,["of your body maybe as perspiration or in another forms."]],[2493,["But what happens that when this liver is"]],[2496,["out of gear it cannot do it, it cannot pass this heat into"]],[2501,["the blood stream and the heat remains in the body"]],[2503,["and you really become heated and that"]],[2507,["heat makes all these problems for you."]],[2512,["So in Sahaja Yoga what happens that when Kundalini rises,"]],[2516,["She changes the form of the blood."]],[2521,["The hydrogen and oxygen which are placed because"]],[2525,["of this heat and all that in a very funny way, like this,"]],[2529,["get like that and they start receiving this heat within them."]],[2532,["That’s why those people who have bad livers feel"]],[2535,["little heat when the Kundalini rises."]],[2537,["But one can cure it by giving it that peace"]],[2540,["and comfort to that liver organ, and you can definitely"]],[2544,["cure your liver, no doubt about it."]],[2547,["Then the second thing that happens to you is"]],[2550,["the pancreas which gives you diabetes."]],[2554,["Only a person who thinks too much gets the diabetes."]],[2557,["For example, an Indian farmer doesn’t know what diabetes is."]],[2560,["But then you stop your sugar, but that’s not the"]],[2563,["way to stop your diabetes. Diabetes comes to you because"]],[2565,["you think, think, think, think, think, too much."]],[2568,["The doctors won’t understand this, that’s why they say it"]],[2570,["is incurable, because they cannot connect"]],[2573,["thinking with the disease."]],[2575,["And this is what happens when you are all the time"]],[2577,["thinking like mad, then diabetes takes place."]],[2580,["And this diabetes is also curable if you get your enlightenment."]],[2585,["You can cure also the diabetes of other people,"]],[2588,["but because this vital power, which is integrated of all"]],[2591,["these three powers flows through you and you can replenish,"]],[2596,["you can give more to other people who are exhausted of it,"]],[2601,["and sort of you can fill them up with this power and you can cure."]],[2605,["But the third one is the worst of all that happens to people"]],[2608,["is blood cancer, because of spleen."]],[2611,["Spleen is one thing very important,"]],[2613,["that it is the center of peace within us."]],[2617,["The one who doesn’t have a proper spleen"]],[2620,["cannot be peaceful person."]],[2622,["Now, it’s a very simple thing but doctors cannot connect it,"]],[2625,["nor all science-oriented people can connect it,"]],[2628,["to something very, very simple."]],[2631,["And the simple thing is that when we eat our food,"]],[2635,["if we are frantic we are out to get trouble with the spleen,"]],[2641,["and we can get blood cancer."]],[2644,["Now if the mother is of that temperament or a father is of that"]],[2647,["temperament, the children might be born with blood cancer."]],[2651,["Now, we’ll be happy to tell you that in New York we had a case"]],[2656,["of blood cancer and when I was in India, in a village,"]],[2660,["somebody came and told Me that such and such boy is sick,"]],[2663,["he’s only sixteen years with blood cancer and doctors have"]],[2666,["declared that he’s going to die within two weeks’ time."]],[2669,["They always declare, they are good at declaration only."]],[2672,["And when this case came to Me, I told them that"]],[2676,["“I cannot do anything, I’m in a village, but you can"]],[2678,["telephone to one of the Sahaja Yoginis."]],[2680,["She was in England, now she is in New York"]],[2683,["and she will look after this case.”"]],[2685,["You’ll be amazed that the boy was cured completely,"]],[2688,["he came out of the hospital, he came to see Me and now"]],[2691,["he’s gone back to his studies."]],[2693,["I mean, it’s like this, we have cured many cases"]],[2695,["of blood cancer, but here we are not to cure people by any…"]],[2701,["or healing anyone, that’s not our job."]],[2703,["It happens spontaneously as a by-product"]],[2706,["of the Kundalini awakening."]],[2708,["Main thing is we have to make you doctors,"]],[2710,["we have to make you knowledgeable people,"]],[2712,["we have to make you collectively conscious human beings"]],[2716,["who have to enter into the Kingdom of God,"]],[2719,["to reside there in His peace, bliss and joy."]],[2724,["Now this trouble of also of kidney, of high blood pressure,"]],[2729,["all that is due to this. People worry, they are frantic,"]],[2733,["you see, and this franticness comes to us"]],[2735,["just as a matter of habit. I’ve known people,"]],[2737,["as soon as you say,"]],[2739,["“Oh, you have to go by aeroplane somewhere,”"]],[2743,["suddenly the aeroplane word triggers that frantic, “Oh!”"]],[2746,["They get mad. They don’t know what they are up to."]],[2749,["They’ll forget their passport, they will forget their luggage,"]],[2751,["they’ll forget this, they are frantic."]],[2753,["At the airport if you go you’ll find this left Nabhi as we call"]],[2757,["this center is, the spleen goes frantic."]],[2761,["Now, when you eat your food or do any such work there"]],[2766,["is an emergency created and more blood"]],[2768,["is needed to digest that food. So this spleen, poor thing,"]],[2772,["works very hard to create that extra amount of blood cells."]],[2779,["But at the time you are eating, you are also, say,"]],[2782,["reading a newspaper, that’s the worst thing"]],[2784,["one should do in the morning. Horrible."]],[2787,["You read the newspaper, you are eating the food,"]],[2789,["your spleen goes off because another emergency comes up."]],[2793,["Then you get on to your bicycle with a sandwich in the hand,"]],[2797,["is even worse than that. And you are rushing to your work,"]],[2801,["suddenly you find a big jam on the way,"]],[2803,["then you are even very badly placed with the situation,"]],[2807,["and you get so frantic and you don’t understand."]],[2809,["And the person who is in front of you go on saying,"]],[2811,["“What’s wrong with this fellow, why can’t he drive fast?”"]],[2814,["and the same fellow is saying something exactly the same"]],[2818,["to the another fellow who is going ahead."]],[2820,["So this madness is on, this rat race is on and if you are"]],[2823,["eating your food in such a hurry and with such franticness,"]],[2829,["you develop this trouble which is very dangerous called"]],[2832,["as blood cancer, and among young people is very common."]],[2837,["Now, the last and not the least is the trouble of the heart."]],[2845,["When you pay too much attention to all these outward things,"]],[2850,["to material things, to your all material advancement,"]],[2855,["to your physical advancement and to so much of a"]],[2860,["computerization of your brain, then you neglect the"]],[2864,["necessary attention to your Spirit which resides"]],[2867,["in your heart; and so the Spirit recedes, and when the Spirit"]],[2873,["recedes you get a heart attack."]],[2876,["Only a person who is right sided gets a heart attack,"]],[2878,["and never a person who is a left sided."]],[2881,["I told this to a doctor and he told, surprisingly,"]],[2886,["that in a mental hospital you never need a cardiogram,"]],[2891,["you do not need it.  They never get a heart attack."]],[2894,["A mad man never gets a heart attack, surprisingly."]],[2897,["A person who is mad is using his heart, his left side,"]],[2903,["his emotions and his heart should go out, but no,"]],[2905,["his brain goes out. Can you imagine?"]],[2907,["And the one who uses the brain, his heart goes out."]],[2911,["This is a balance created by the nature in us."]],[2913,["See how cleverly the nature is trying to guide us"]],[2917,["in the center: don’t go to the extremes, keep to the center,"]],[2921,["keep to the center, and then when you are absolutely"]],[2925,["in the center, then you get your evolution very quickly."]],[2932,["So this is the right side that we have, the futuristic side,"]],[2935,["and as you know we are all very futuristic by temperament."]],[2940,["This futuristicness cannot be cured by telling,"]],[2943,["“Oh, now, don’t think,” you cannot do it,"]],[2946,["you just cannot do it. If I order you that"]],[2948,["“Now, you better stop planning,” you just can’t do it,"]],[2952,["you can’t help it. You have to do that kind of planning."]],[2955,["And you find all these plans fail because these plans"]],[2958,["are not related to the plans of the Divine."]],[2961,["Divine has some other plans while you have some other plans"]],[2964,["and they never combine together, and that’s how you find"]],[2968,["all your plans fail and you are just frustrated,"]],[2971,["left high and dry."]],[2972,["You don’t understand how it has happened."]],[2975,["For your understanding, one has to know that"]],[2979,["there is a Divine Power.  You may like it or not."]],[2985,["All this living work that is done - millions and millions"]],[2988,["flowers which are becoming fruits, a seed becoming a tree,"]],[2993,["a particular seed becomes a particular tree,"]],[2995,["all the choices that are made, the whole organized way"]],[2998,["the chemical acts, the way the chemistry is made"]],[3003,["of periodic laws - everything you see in this world"]],[3006,["is all so well organized, there has to be somebody doing it."]],[3010,["So there is a Divine Power which is surrounding us,"]],[3013,["no doubt about it. But we have not yet felt it, that’s all."]],[3016,["If we have not felt it that doesn’t mean it doesn’t exist."]],[3019,["It does exist and it works out. We have seen with our own"]],[3023,["experience that so many living things are happening."]],[3026,["We just take it for granted, we are not bothered."]],[3028,["See, in human life itself, a child is to be born,"]],[3032,["then a fetus is held in the body."]],[3035,["Normally the law of medical science is this:"]],[3039,["that anything foreign, if it enters into the body,"]],[3041,["is thrown away immediately, all the forces"]],[3044,["are built up to throw it away."]],[3046,["But what we find that when a fetus is built up the whole"]],[3050,["system works out to nourish it, to look after it,"]],[3053,["to really to bother about it."]],[3055,["Very carefully the water is created around it so that"]],[3059,["it is not disturbed, and every sort of a care is taken"]],[3062,["by the body to look after the fetus,"]],[3064,["and when the fetus is ready, it is thrown out."]],[3069,["Who does that? Who does that?"]],[3072,["We must ask these questions to ourselves sometimes."]],[3074,["After all why have we become human beings?"]],[3078,["What was the need? What was the need?"]],[3081,["And if we haven’t got the answer that means we are still in"]],[3083,["transition, and we have to get there where we get the answer."]],[3088,["We are made humans beings to feel that Divine Power,"]],[3094,["to maneuver that Divine Power and thus"]],[3097,["enjoy the bliss of divinity. That Divine Power is"]],[3104,["the Collective Being, that gives us collectivity."]],[3107,["The Spirit in our heart is the one which is the"]],[3110,["Collective Being within us, which manifests that"]],[3113,["Divine Power to flow through us."]],[3116,["And that’s how, once we are connected to the mains,"]],[3119,["we start becoming what we are for. Like a machine,"]],[3125,["once it is put to the mains it gets its meaning;"]],[3129,["but this machine, though it is put to the mains,"]],[3131,["is not aware of the electricity, about My voice, anything."]],[3135,["But a human being, when he gets connected with the mains,"]],[3140,["then he becomes aware and this is what you must see."]],[3144,["When you get realized you can raise the Kundalini of others,"]],[3149,["you can give Realization to others."]],[3151,["Ray himself has done to so many. Even in Riyadh, he did it."]],[3154,["He did it everywhere wherever he went."]],[3156,["He’s just like you, he’s an engineer, he’s just like you,"]],[3160,["he was just like you, and now you’ll be amazed that"]],[3162,["how much he knows about himself and about others."]],[3166,["And a complete change has come because once you get"]],[3170,["the Spirit, when you get the highest,"]],[3172,["all these mundane things drop out and you"]],[3175,["become a master of yourself. No more enslavement of any"]],[3178,["habits or anything, it just works out beautifully."]],[3181,["But one must give a chance to oneself and one"]],[3184,["must have patience. The worst part of intelligence, so-called,"]],[3189,["is that you can make fun of everything. That’s the easiest way,"]],[3192,["to make fun of everything and get rid of it."]],[3196,["In olden times when they wanted to face the reality,"]],[3199,["like when Christ came in, they didn’t make fun of Him."]],[3201,["But they did at the time when He was crucified,"]],[3204,["but they just denied. But now it is not basically problem,"]],[3208,["that problem doesn’t exist because to deny, you see,"]],[3212,["it requires more effort, so is better to make fun."]],[3215,["Is stupidity, again as I said, is stupidity to make fun"]],[3219,["of something because you are that, you are the Spirit."]],[3223,["You are the one who has to get it and if you just know"]],[3226,["how to make fun, please go and play about with it."]],[3229,["All your life you’ll go on, all your lives"]],[3231,["you’ll go on, what’s the use?"]],[3233,["And if you do not get your Realization,"]],[3237,["in the words of your judgment you have failed,"]],[3242,["you have failed and there is a chance given to you."]],[3246,["You can be comforted and you can be counseled,"]],[3250,["you can be redeemed; but nobody can make you taste"]],[3254,["the beauty of your own being, that you have to do it yourself."]],[3258,["If you do not want to do it, all right.  It’s perfectly all right."]],[3262,["You are free to do it, do what you like."]],[3264,["But if you want to do it, then please stop your guru-shopping"]],[3269,["and wobbling, stop and see for yourself what you need."]],[3273,["It’s a serious thing, which should happen."]],[3275,["Unless and until human beings are evolved,"]],[3278,["none of the problems of the world are going to be solved,"]],[3280,["none of the problems, take it from Me."]],[3282,["Whatever they have done by their thinking - say they have"]],[3284,["created democracy, they have created communism, this,"]],[3290,["that, all this nonsense, has no meaning at all in reality,"]],[3294,["it has no meaning. Because, say for example you might say"]],[3297,["I’m very powerful so I’m a capitalist."]],[3300,["But I can’t live without giving to others, so I’m a communist."]],[3303,["I’m a complete capitalist and a complete communist."]],[3307,["Everything exists within Me, and these ideas are all artificial"]],[3310,["that you make some set of people as democratic"]],[3313,["and some people as this thing."]],[3315,["Because as long as they are attached to selfishness, to all"]],[3319,["these things, they are not going to do any good job out of it."]],[3322,["Now, the detachment takes place because you become"]],[3326,["one with the Spirit, which is not attached,"]],[3330,["which gives you that light, that detachment from where"]],[3334,["you can see the whole thing just as a drama going on."]],[3337,["And you work it out very well. You become so dynamic,"]],[3340,["so dynamic that you are amazed at your own dynamism."]],[3343,["Apart from that, one has to realize if there is a Power,"]],[3346,["which is an all-pervading Power, that Power itself thinks,"]],[3350,["organizes and looks after you."]],[3353,["So many things have happened to Sahaja Yogis that if"]],[3357,["I have to tell you all about it, you’ll be amazed."]],[3360,["Amazing things have happened."]],[3362,["But Krishna has said very clearly, “yogakshema vahamyaham,”"]],[3365,["means “When you get the yoga, you’ll get the well being.”"]],[3370,["After yoga. He said yoga first, first the union must take place,"]],[3374,["then you’ll get the well being."]],[3376,["Now I’ve seen people who go to so-called gurus and things,"]],[3379,["sick, you see their faces pale, absolutely finished,"]],[3383,["they are good for nothing, absolutely miserable people."]],[3386,["And how such people could be in yoga?"]],[3389,["Not only physically, mentally they are at peace,"]],[3393,["they are full of compassion and love."]],[3394,["And the compassion that doesn’t talk, but just flows, it flows,"]],[3398,["it emits, you can give your compassion even to flowers."]],[3401,["If the flowers are dying, you can give them this and"]],[3404,["they will live for a while.  If there are, say,"]],[3406,["trees which are dying, if you give them they will prosper."]],[3409,["If you give it to animals, they’ll be different because"]],[3411,["first time, after getting this power only, you are giving"]],[3415,["back something to the nature."]],[3417,["So far you have been always taking from the nature."]],[3420,["Now it is the first time you start giving"]],[3421,["something to the nature. Because the compassion just flows,"]],[3425,["it doesn’t receive anything, it just flows to others"]],[3428,["and this should happen to you."]],[3430,["Don’t be satisfied with cheap things, with something nonsensical,"]],[3433,["which is something sort of a mimicry or a mass ideas."]],[3440,["I am talking of collectivity where every individual is aware."]],[3445,["It’s not a mass activity, it is collectivity. May God bless you."]],[3450,["I hope today many will get Realization and become one"]],[3454,["with their Spirits and will feel their collectivity."]],[3457,["That’s only My hope is. Brighton I place very high up in"]],[3461,["England and I always said England is the heart of the universe."]],[3464,["It is very important that it is the heart, no doubt,"]],[3467,["and that’s why Blake has said that it has to become Jerusalem."]],[3470,["There’s lot of truth in what he has said."]],[3472,["Lots of things he has said about Sahaja Yoga"]],[3474,["is absolutely proved. But the heart is sluggish."]],[3479,["Heart is sleeping, is a sad thing."]],[3482,["Like I say that Europe is the liver and it is drinking,"]],[3487,["can you imagine what will be the state of affairs of this,"]],[3489,["universe, if everything is going against one’s own essence?"]],[3493,["And the essence of English is that it is the heart."]],[3498,["That means it articulates, it circulates."]],[3501,["Whatever happens in England is taken up seriously."]],[3504,["Supposing you become, all of you, stupid people,"]],[3506,["the whole world will become."]],[3508,["The responsibility is such a lot on you,"]],[3510,["which you do not realize."]],[3512,["It’s a very important thing that we are doing."]],[3514,["It looks very small in this country because there are very"]],[3518,["few people who really come to Sahaja Yoga and settle down."]],[3521,["Very few people, there are very few of that caliber I think."]],[3524,["Young little children are there, many will come up"]],[3527,["by about, say, ten years or so."]],[3529,["I’m sure there will be a very good quality of people"]],[3533,["who will be coming and the seekers who are here,"]],[3535,["are also sort of little nervous because they want to learn"]],[3538,["from Americans and from Europeans."]],[3540,["There’s nothing to be learned from them."]],[3542,["It is you who are going to circulate;"]],[3544,["you are going to carry the message."]],[3545,["I know it’s a very important country, and somehow it was"]],[3549,["managed that My husband could get his election"]],[3551,["done in England and we are here now"]],[3553,["for last eight years, can you believe it?"]],[3555,["And I’ll be here maybe again four years more, at the most."]],[3560,["So I hope something will happen and this Brighton,"]],[3563,["which is a very good place, I’m sure here also many will get"]],[3568,["their Realization and will help"]],[3571,["in the emancipation of human beings."]],[3574,["Thank you very much. May God bless you."]],[3577,["If you have any questions you must ask Me."]],[3590,["In all frankness I must tell you I’m your Mother;"]],[3593,["I never feel offended you ask Me a question."]],[3596,["Is important because, actually, I have no question."]],[3599,["You have to ask Me, I have no question at all."]]]);
